sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Client as Storefront / Backoffice\n(Next.js 16)
	participant GW as API Gateway\n(YARP)
	participant Rating as Rating API\n(.NET 11 + Cosmos DB)
	participant Kafka as Kafka Broker\n(CloudEvents JSON)
	participant Cat as Catalog API\n(.NET 11 + PostgreSQL)

	Client ->> GW: HTTPS POST /rating/api/v1/feedbacks (Entra ID JWT)
	GW ->> Rating: Forward POST /api/v1/feedbacks
	Rating ->> Rating: Validate & persist Feedback in Cosmos DB (ratingdb/feedbacks, /bookId)
	Rating -->> Client: 201 Created
	Rating ->> Kafka: FeedbackCreatedIntegrationEvent (key: BookId/FeedbackId)
	Kafka ->> Cat: Deliver to Catalog API (PostgreSQL inbox + Redis idempotency)

	alt Book exists in catalogdb
		Cat ->> Cat: Recalculate derived average rating & review count on Book
	else Book does not exist
		Cat ->> Kafka: BookUpdatedRatingFailedIntegrationEvent
		Kafka ->> Rating: Deliver compensation event
		Rating ->> Rating: Delete invalid Feedback from Cosmos DB
	end

	Note over Client,Cat: Deletion path: DELETE /rating/api/v1/feedbacks/{id} -> FeedbackDeletedIntegrationEvent -> Catalog decrements derived summary
